2. getParentSchema().getSchemaLocation() returns null => NPE.
3. Both schemaLocation and parentSchemaLocation are null => first call NPE? Actually we call getSchemaLocation().getAbsoluteIri() first; if getSchemaLocation() null, NPE before checking parent. So scenario 1 covers both.

